1200 GOSUB 6320:BM$="Alan: Would you look at that? David, up in the early morning, having coffee!\You don't see that every day. Were you too nervous about our last\concert in Europe to sleep?":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1210 GOSUB 6300:BM$="David: Not really, I actually got a good night's rest, so much that I just woke\up early.":GOSUB 5100
1220 BM$="David: Do you think Krost is dead?":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1230 GOSUB 6320:BM$="Alan: Dunno. I haven't read the English newspaper yet. Let's take a look.":GOSUB 5100
1240 BM$="Alan picked up the newspaper from the table.":GOSUB 5100
1250 BM$="Alan: ...Well, I don't see anything about it...":GOSUB 5100
1260 BM$="Alan: Oh wait, here it is. It's a small print in the corner. Hmmm... It just says\they stopped the blood loss and he survived.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1270 GOSUB 6300:BM$="David: What do you know? He's alive. Considering how much he was bleeding,\that's actually impressive.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1280 GOSUB 6320:BM$="Alan: Modern medicine can even transplant hearts nowadays. Bleeding\from your forehead is nothing in comparison.":GOSUB 5100
1290 BM$="While David and Alan were talking about Krost, they were joined by\Andrew and Susanna.":GOSUB 5100
1300 GOSUB 6340:BM$="Susanna: Oh, you're reading the newspaper? I've heard something\interesting about Krost.":GOSUB 5100
1310 BM$="Susanna: Our promoter told me that his third eye is actually artificial. He\had that surgically implanted into his forehead.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1320 GOSUB 6300:BM$="David: Seriously? An artificial eye?":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1330 GOSUB 6340:BM$="Susanna: They say his psychic powers are the real deal, but he underwent\plastic surgery to hide that scar, and to make himself look more like an\ESPer.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1340 GOSUB 6330:BM$="Andrew: What's the point? He already had psychic powers... Man, what a\moron.":GOSUB 5100
1350 BM$="At that moment, Martin entered the lobby.":GOSUB 5100
1360 GOSUB 6310:BM$="Martin: Good morning. You're all already up, huh? This has to be the first\time I got up later than David.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1370 GOSUB 6340:BM$="Susanna: Okay, so... After tonight's concert, we'll be back in London\tomorrow, at noon. Andrew, make sure you leave the hotel by 4 pm and\head straight for the venue.":GOSUB 5100
